<title>FINLAND: PARTEK SAYS AKER'S GJELSTEN TO JOIN BOARD.</title>
<headline>PARTEK SAYS AKER'S GJELSTEN TO JOIN BOARD.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish building materials group Partek Oy Ab said on Monday it proposed to an extraordinary shareholders meeting on November 25 the appointment of Aker's new CEO Bjorn-Rune Gjelsten to its board.</p>
<p>Board member Tom Ruud had given notice of his resignation due to his appointment as CEO of Norway's second largest bank Kreditkassen , it said in a statement.</p>
<p>&quot;Aker ASA has announced that they will appoint Mr Bjorn-Rune Gjelsten, Aker's new CEO, to Partek's board of directors,&quot; Partek said.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-6805 0245</p>
</text>
